+    """Generates //msvc/tree, //winsdk/tree and //msbuild facades.
+
+    These expose whole toolchain trees plus an anchor file per tree, for build
+    systems that locate their own tools (MSBuild) instead of resolving a
+    `cc_toolchain`. Marker files exist so a genrule can recover a tree's root
+    directory from a `$(location)` expansion.
