+    """Returns the key of the oldest channel manifest shipping the given MSVC version.
+
+    ``list_msvc_version`` prefers the newest channel when versions overlap, which is
+    the wrong choice for MSBuild: its VC project system has to come from the Visual
+    Studio line that released the toolset, otherwise a pinned compiler is driven by a
+    newer PlatformToolset than it was built for.
